</head><body class="__variable_geist_19ysh9d __variable_geist_mono_1001rt9 antialiased"><main class="_page_1729u_1"><header class="_header_1729u_6"><a href="/">← Mathematics Atlas</a><span>6,603<!-- --> subject categories · MSC2020</span></header><nav class="_breadcrumbs_1729u_6" aria-label="Subject hierarchy"><a href="/subjects">All major subjects</a><a href="/subjects/00-XX">00-XX<!-- --> · <!-- -->General and overarching topics; collections</a><a href="/subjects/00Axx">00Axx<!-- --> · <!-- -->General and miscellaneous specific topics</a></nav><span class="_code_1729u_16">00A15<!-- --> · MSC2020 classification</span><h1>Bibliographies for mathematics in general</h1><p>Bibliographies for mathematics in general [See also 01A70 and the classification number --00 in the other sections]</p><p class="_scope_1729u_7">A category for organizing mathematical literature. The references below are subject links from the source; they do not establish equivalent problems or interchangeable solutions.</p><form class="_search_1729u_8" action="/subjects"><label>Subject name, phrase or MSC code<input type="search" maxLength="300" placeholder="Try algorithms, biology or 68Q25" name="q" value=""/></label><input type="hidden" name="parent" value="all"/><button type="submit">Search subjects</button></form><section aria-label="More specific subjects"><h2>Within this subject</h2><p>This is a leaf category in this classification. More detailed knowledge may exist within it.</p></section><section aria-label="Outgoing source cross-references"><h2>Related subjects from this entry</h2><article class="_reference_1729u_19"><h3>See also</h3><p><a href="/subjects/00A15">00A15<!-- --> · <!-- -->Bibliographies for mathematics in general</a> → <a href="/subjects/01A70">01A70<!-- --> · <!-- -->Biographies, obituaries, personalia, bibliographies</a></p><details><summary>Source reference and conditions</summary><pre>{
